Business interpretation
Status	       Business meaning
Confirmed	     Customer booking accepted
Completed	     Shipment completed
Cancelled	     Booking cancelled
Rolled	       Booking moved to another sailing

Three observations:
- 57.6% are confirmed, representing the largest booking category.
- 8.23% are cancelled, which deserves further investigation.
- 10.08% are rolled, potentially indicating capacity constraints, scheduling changes or operational disruptions.
Important: A rolled booking is not necessarily a failed shipment. It may simply have been transferred to a later sailing.

